<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 1.077 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 1.077 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 1.077 billion pesos into the secondary market on Friday through two credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>    550 million     4 days</p>
<p>    527 million     3 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
